return {
    ["\n岁月如棋，落子无悔，一步踏错，便是百年。\n\n一副古老的棋盘静置于案，被放缓的时间里，隐约能看到一只大手和一只小手下棋的旧影。罗塞尔曾与贝尔纳黛对弈，谈起“烂柯棋局”的传说——那山中樵夫观棋片刻，人间已过百年。\n\n那时贝尔纳黛听不懂什么是烂柯，不懂为什么父亲总会把棋子下在交叉点上，也不懂什么是“观棋不语真君子，落子无悔大丈夫”，她只记得耍赖悔棋时父亲会轻拍她的头顶，手掌宽厚而温暖。"] = "\nYears are like a game of chess; once a piece is placed, there is no turning back. One wrong step, and a century passes.\n\nAn ancient chessboard sat quietly on the desk. In the slowed time, one could vaguely see the old shadows of a large hand and a small hand playing chess. Roselle once played against Bernadette and spoke of the legend of the \"Rotten Axe Chess Game\"—the woodcutter watched the game for a moment, and a century had passed in the human world.\n\nBack then, Bernadette didn't understand what a \"rotten axe\" was, didn't understand why her father always placed his pieces on the intersections, and didn't understand what it meant to be \"a true gentleman who watches in silence and a real man who never regrets his move.\" She only remembered that when she tried to cheat or take back a move, her father would gently pat her head, his palm broad and warm.",
    ["        我看不清楚祂真正的模样，只觉得这丰饶的气息似曾相识……"] = "        I cannot see His true appearance clearly, I only feel that this scent of abundance is familiar...",
