    ["<DecH>工艺：</>蕾丝软缎・黑紫荷叶・哥特街装\n不屑解释也无意顺从，叛逆者会在午夜准时到场。惊情一刻就在此时。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Lace Satin - Black-Purple Frills - Gothic Streetwear\nToo proud to explain and with no intention to conform, the rebel will arrive on time at midnight. The moment of thrill is now.",
