    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>驼色软呢・洁白内衬・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・White Lining・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Italic>——名为“你”的存在消失了。 而某种更古老、更邪异的东西从你的躯壳里站起来，它吞噬了你的精神，征服了你的皮囊，它不懂什么是朋友，无法辨认方向，更不认识任何语言。 它只知道猎物。你已成为毫无理智的怪物。</>"] = "<Italic>—The existence known as \"you\" has vanished. Instead, something more ancient and sinister has risen from your shell. It has devoured your spirit and conquered your flesh; it knows not what a friend is, cannot discern direction, and recognizes no language. It only knows prey. You have become a monster devoid of all reason.</>",
