    ["铁黑色的斧身沉甸甸的，闪电和飓风般的花纹蔓延着这把斧头的表层。\n戴里克睁眼的时候，看见的就是这把“飓风之斧”。\n那是“愚者”的赐予。\n他在白银城的天空下握紧这把斧头。这里终年电闪雷鸣，闪电是唯一的光。\n他想象自己的每一次挥斧！劈出闪电的斧头，将那片黑暗撕开裂缝。闪电一道接一道地从斧刃迸发，和天空的雷鸣交织成网。 \n这把斧头在他手中，就是风暴本身。"] = "The iron-black axe head was heavy, with patterns like lightning and hurricanes spreading across the surface of the axe. \n When Derrick opened his eyes, this was the \"Hurricane Axe\" he saw. \n It was a gift from The Fool. \n He gripped this axe under the sky of the City of Silver. Here, there is thunder and lightning all year round, and lightning is the only light. \n He imagined every swing of his axe! The axe that cleaved lightning tore open a crack in that darkness. Bolts of lightning erupted one after another from the axe blade, weaving into a net with the thunder in the sky. \n This axe in his hand was the storm itself.",
